msgstr "Alışukesäneñ Salanğan Eçtälege"

#: privacy.cpp:100
msgid "Web History"
msgstr "Web Uzğannarı"

#: privacy.cpp:102
msgid "Web Cache"
msgstr "Web Alxätere"

#: privacy.cpp:104
msgid "Form Completion Entries"
msgstr "Form Tutıru Keremnäre"

#: privacy.cpp:106
msgid "Recent Documents"
msgstr "Soñğı İstäleklär"

#: privacy.cpp:108
msgid "Quick Start Menu"
msgstr "Tiz Başlaw Saylağı"

#: privacy.cpp:110
msgid "Favorite Icons"
msgstr "Saylanma Tamğası"

#: privacy.cpp:112
msgid "Check all cleanup actions you would like to perform. These will be executed by pressing the button below"
msgstr "Qılası kilgän buşatu eşlären saylap quyası. Astağı töymägä çirtü aşa bonı eşläp bula"

#: privacy.cpp:113
msgid "Immediately performs the cleanup actions selected above"
msgstr "Alda saylanğan buşatu eşlären şunda uq eşlätä"

#: privacy.cpp:115
msgid "Clears all cached thumbnails"
msgstr "Alxäterdäge töymäsürätlär buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:116
msgid "Clears the history of commands run through the Run Command tool on the desktop"
msgstr "Östälneñ Boyırıq Cibärü aşa eşlätelgän boyırıqlar tezmäsen buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:117
msgid "Clears all stored cookies set by websites"
msgstr "Web-säxifälärneñ saqlanğan cookie'larnı buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:118
msgid "Clears the history of visited websites"
msgstr "Säxifälärgä kerü uzışın buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:119
msgid "Clears the clipboard contents stored by Klipper"
msgstr "Klipper saqlağan alışukeşä eçtälegen buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:120
msgid "Clears the temporary cache of websites visited"
msgstr "Kerelgän säxifälär bitläre belän alxäterne buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:121
msgid "Clears values which were entered into forms on websites"
msgstr "Törle säxifälärneñ formlarında kertelgän bäyälärdän buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:122
msgid "Clears the list of recently used documents from the KDE applications menu"
msgstr "KDE-yazılımnarda baya açılğan istäleklär tezmäsen buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:123
msgid "Clears the entries from the list of recently started applications"
msgstr "Baya cibärelgän yazılımnar tezmäsen keremnärdän buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:124
msgid "Clears the FavIcons cached from visited websites"
msgstr "Kerelgän säxifälärdän tamğalar alxäteren buşatu"

#: privacy.cpp:247
msgid "You are deleting data that is potentially valuable to you. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Kiräk bula ala torğan belem beterelä. Çınlap ta beteräseme?"

#: privacy.cpp:250
msgid "Starting cleanup..."
msgstr "Buşatu başlaw..."

#: privacy.cpp:259
msgid "Clearing %1..."
msgstr "%1 Buşatu..."

#: privacy.cpp:294
msgid "Clearing of %1 failed"
msgstr "%1 buşatıp bulmadı"

#: privacy.cpp:301
msgid "Clean up finished."
msgstr "Buşatu eşlänep bette."

